WEBVTT

00:06:58.729 --> 00:07:01.828
I believe most aid is better than just

00:07:01.828 --> 00:07:03.740
throwing money out of a plane.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:06.288
I am also absolutely certain

00:07:06.288 --> 00:07:08.521
that a lot of aid today

00:07:08.521 --> 00:07:12.046
isn't better than giving directly to the poor.

00:07:12.046 --> 00:07:15.922
I hope that one day, it will be.

00:07:15.922 --> 00:07:17.978
Thank you.

00:07:17.978 --> 00:07:21.945
(Applause)